source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-24
observed: A raw `]` ends the link wherever it stands, so the title stops in front of it and the rest is text.
-- input.jira --
[x|http://x|t]u]
-- rendered.html --
<p><a href="http://x" title="t" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">x</a>u]</p>
-- want.md --
[x](http://x "t")u\]
-- warnings.json --
[]
